  ('2023-12-18', $b$Obadiah 1:$b$, $b$<ul><li><p>Your own works and achievements are nothing, put God first in everything</p></li></ul>$b$, $b$Revelation 9:$b$, $b$<ul><li><p>Abyss!!!!</p></li><li><p>How stupid are the people not to repent after experiencing them woes?!?!?</p></li></ul><p>Better start repenting if God starts throwing horse-like locusts at you</p>$b$),
  ('2023-12-19', $b$Jonah 1:1-4:11$b$, $b$<ul><li><p>Respect to the men who tried to row back to land, though</p></li><li><p>Wonder what fish ate jonah. Must’ve been pretty freaky for him. (both the fish and jonah, actually)</p></li><li><p>What a good king of nineveh to repent. Not a lot of that happens with israel.</p></li></ul>$b$, $b$Revelation 10:1-11$b$, $b$<ul><li><p>Yummy scrolls</p></li></ul><p>God will forgive if you repent.</p>$b$),
